  "title": "At the café: ordering without pointing",
  "title_target": "У кафе — U kafe",
  "goal": "Order food and drinks in full sentences, ask for the bill, and meet the fourth case (знахідний, the accusative) — the case that marks what you want, drink, and eat.",
